{"route":"/docs/6.0/components/progress/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Progress","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for using Bootstrap custom progress bars featuring support for stacked bars, animated backgrounds, and text labels."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Progress components are built with two HTML elements, some CSS to set the width, and a few attributes. We don’t use <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/progress\">the HTML5 <code>&lt;progress&gt;</code> element</a>, ensuring you can stack progress bars, animate them, and place text labels over them."},{"id":"how-it-works--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-1","type":"item","en":"We use the <code>.progress</code> as a wrapper to indicate the max value of the progress bar."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-2","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress</code> wrapper also requires a <code>role=&quot;progressbar&quot;</code> and <code>aria</code> attributes to make it accessible, including an accessible name (using <code>aria-label</code>, <code>aria-labelledby</code>, or similar)."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-3","type":"item","en":"We use the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> purely for the visual bar and label."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-4","type":"item","en":"The <code>.progress-bar</code> requires an inline style, utility class, or custom CSS to set its width."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-5","type":"item","en":"We provide a special <code>.progress-stacked</code> class to create multiple/stacked progress bars."}]}]},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Put that all together, and you have the following examples."},{"id":"how-it-works--example-1","type":"demo","key":"488c12b5f748eb759de8","height":300},{"id":"how-it-works--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"bar-sizing","type":"heading","en":"Bar sizing","level":2},{"id":"width","type":"heading","en":"Width","level":3},{"id":"width--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap provides a handful of <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/width\">utilities for setting width</a>. Depending on your needs, these may help with quickly configuring the width of the <code>.progress-bar</code>."},{"id":"width--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d8f2715409dc50f17a60","height":147},{"id":"width--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\"></div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"height","type":"heading","en":"Height","level":3},{"id":"height--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You only set a <code>height</code> value on the <code>.progress</code> container, so if you change that value, the inner <code>.progress-bar</code> will automatically resize accordingly."},{"id":"height--example-1","type":"demo","key":"672e1a546e0ac9de7d79","height":174},{"id":"height--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 1px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 1px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 20px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 20px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"labels","type":"heading","en":"Labels","level":2},{"id":"labels--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add labels to your progress bars by placing text within the <code>.progress-bar</code>."},{"id":"labels--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3d97938259838d37d6fd","height":147},{"id":"labels--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example with label\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"long-labels","type":"heading","en":"Long labels","level":3},{"id":"long-labels--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Note that by default, the content inside the <code>.progress-bar</code> is controlled with <code>overflow: hidden</code>, so it doesn’t bleed out of the bar. If your progress bar is shorter than its label, the content will be capped and may become unreadable. To change this behavior, you can use <code>.overflow-visible</code> from the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/overflow\">overflow utilities</a>."},{"id":"long-labels--note-1","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"long-labels--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Labels longer than the progress bar within may not be fully accessible using this method because it relies on the text color having the correct contrast ratio with both the <code>.progress</code> and <code>.progress-bar</code> background colors. Use caution when implementing this example."},{"id":"long-labels--note-text-2","type":"note-text","en":"If the text can overlap the progress bar, we often recommend displaying the label outside of the progress bar for better accessibility."}]},{"id":"backgrounds","type":"heading","en":"Backgrounds","level":2},{"id":"backgrounds--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use background utility classes to change the appearance of individual progress bars."},{"id":"backgrounds--example-1","type":"demo","key":"2ec827c6e7e27ee37075","height":228},{"id":"backgrounds--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"backgrounds--caption-1","type":"caption","en":"Accessibility Tip: Using color to convey meaning"},{"id":"backgrounds--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Using color to add meaning only provides a visual indication, which will not be conveyed to users of assistive technologies like screen readers. Please ensure the meaning is obvious from the content itself (e.g., the visible text with a <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility/#color-contrast\"><em>sufficient</em> color contrast</a>) or is included through alternative means, such as additional text hidden with the <code>.visually-hidden</code> class."},{"id":"backgrounds--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"If you’re adding labels to progress bars with a custom background color, make sure to also set an appropriate <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/colors#colors\">text color</a>, so the labels remain readable and have sufficient contrast. We recommend using the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/theme#contrast\">theme contrast</a> helper classes."},{"id":"backgrounds--example-2","type":"demo","key":"b0c9a655931a709269db","height":228},{"id":"backgrounds--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-success\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-info\" style=\"width: 50%\">50%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\">75%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\">100%</div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"multiple-bars","type":"heading","en":"Multiple bars","level":2},{"id":"multiple-bars--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can include multiple progress components inside a container with <code>.progress-stacked</code> to create a single stacked progress bar. Note that in this case, the styling to set the visual width of the progress bar <em>must</em> be applied to the <code>.progress</code> elements, rather than the <code>.progress-bar</code>s."},{"id":"multiple-bars--example-1","type":"demo","key":"343cf2bf7c2e2236e2a0","height":147},{"id":"multiple-bars--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress-stacked\">\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment one\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 15%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment two\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 30%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment three\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 20%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"striped","type":"heading","en":"Striped","level":2},{"id":"striped--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.progress-bar-striped</code> to any <code>.progress-bar</code> to apply a stripe via CSS gradient over the progress bar’s background color."},{"id":"striped--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a4effafdec3b53d353c2","height":300},{"id":"striped--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Default striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"10\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped\" style=\"width: 10%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"animated-stripes","type":"heading","en":"Animated stripes","level":2},{"id":"animated-stripes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The striped gradient can also be animated. Add <code>.progress-bar-animated</code> to <code>.progress-bar</code> to animate the stripes right to left via CSS3 animations."},{"id":"animated-stripes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3bd22cc9efcf1fff9474","height":147},{"id":"animated-stripes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Animated striped example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Progress use local CSS variables on <code>.progress</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$progress-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --progress-height: 1rem,\n    --progress-font-size: var(--font-size-sm),\n    --progress-bg: var(--bg-2),\n    --progress-border-radius: var(--radius-5),\n    --progress-box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-inset),\n    --progress-bar-color: var(--white),\n    --progress-bar-bg: var(--primary-bg),\n    --progress-bar-transition: width .6s ease,\n    --progress-bar-animation: progress-bar-stripes 1s linear infinite,\n  ),\n  $progress-tokens\n);","language":""},{"id":"keyframes","type":"heading","en":"Keyframes","level":3},{"id":"keyframes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Used for creating the CSS animations for <code>.progress-bar-animated</code>. Included in <code>scss/_progress-bar.scss</code>."},{"id":"keyframes--code-1","type":"code","value":"@if $enable-transitions {\n  @keyframes progress-bar-stripes {\n    0% { background-position-x: var(--progress-height); }\n  }\n}","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"488c12b5f748eb759de8","html":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d8f2715409dc50f17a60","html":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Basic example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar w-75\"></div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"672e1a546e0ac9de7d79","html":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 1px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 1px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example 20px high\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"height: 20px\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"3d97938259838d37d6fd","html":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Example with label\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"2ec827c6e7e27ee37075","html":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\" style=\"width: 25%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar bg-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b0c9a655931a709269db","html":"<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Success example\" aria-valuenow=\"25\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-success\" style=\"width: 25%\">25%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Info example\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-info\" style=\"width: 50%\">50%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Warning example\" aria-valuenow=\"75\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-warning\" style=\"width: 75%\">75%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Danger example\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\">\n  <div class=\"progress-bar theme-danger\" style=\"width: 100%\">100%</div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example vstack gap-3"},"sprite":""},{"key":"343cf2bf7c2e2236e2a0","html":"<div class=\"progress-stacked\">\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment one\" aria-valuenow=\"15\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 15%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment two\" aria-valuenow=\"30\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 30%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-success\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Segment three\" aria-valuenow=\"20\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" style=\"width: 20%\">\n    <div class=\"progress-bar bg-info\"></